    "artifacts": [],
    "representation": "Archived alphabet runes only, headings retained, each page separate; zero-based indices and literal GP prime values.",
    "procedure": "Compute forward differences of orders 2–9 and their integer gcd for each nonempty page and representation; independently verify using binomial sums from page JSON.",
    "parameters": "56 page files; 55 nonempty streams; two representations; eight degree bounds; arbitrary integer origin and fixed signed stride; all integer moduli m>1 by divisibility argument.",
    "exclusions": "Unknown plaintext or keystream mixing, degree above eight, extra output maps, skipped clock positions, internal resets, alternative transcriptions and LP2-56–57."
  },
  "outcome": "not-supported",
  "finding": "Every one of the 880 checks has gcd 1. No direct polynomial stream satisfying the stated assumptions can match any of the 55 nonempty pages. LP2-50 is empty in rune coordinates and skipped.",
  "limitations": "An exact exclusion for a defined direct-output model, not a general rejection of polynomial keys or arithmetic ciphers. Depends on archived transcription. Elementary proof plus exact computation; the earlier Lean development was not rerun. Human review pending.",
  "next_steps": "Treat changed clocks, plaintext mixing, other representations or degree limits as separately specified variants, and rerun if the input transcription changes.",
